---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
<main>

<img src="/community.jpg" alt="Share your Malta community" />

<h1>Share your Malta</h1>

<p>Creating opportunities through community.</p>

<p>
What makes Malta special? Perhaps it's the people, the traditions, the stories,
and the places only locals know. Could sharing something you already do also earn you a little extra? 
</p>

<p>
What do you enjoy? Do you have a garden café? A classic car? A fishing boat?
Is your grandma the best cook? Do you know local history or Malta's beautiful
stone buildings? The perfect sunset? A hidden snorkeling spot? Would you enjoy
welcoming visitors at the airport? Maybe yoga, hiking, horses? Family traditions?
Or... something nobody has thought of yet. 
</p>

<p> 
Everyone belongs, contributes and benefits. Want to help build something new?
This is just the beginning, just sharing of ideas. The goal is creating
friendships, opportunities, and experiences that benefit everyone. 
</p>
			
<p> 
We hope visitors will experience Malta through the people who live here. Creating memories they'll take home. We believe tourism should leave communities stronger than it found them. 
</p>

<p> 
The best ideas often begin with "what if?" We'd love to hear from you. Every message will be read. Every idea will be considered. This may take time, but every community starts with one conversation, -perhaps yours. Reach us at connect@ourmalta.org
</p>

<p> 
In anticipation, 
</p>

<p>
Carmela
</p>

<p>
Contact us:
<a href="mailto:connect@ourmalta.org">connect@ourmalta.org</a>
</p>

</main>
<Footer />
</body>
</html>
